Node ID=1 delivered
Text=<She does not rise from the reliquary's step. Two of the creatures coil at her feet; a third, older, stands behind her with its hands folded. She looks at you the way one looks at a parcel.> You walked in. Good. It saves rope. <A pause.> The Master has what he came for. What he wants now is you, whole, and north. I was left here to see to it.
