Node ID=50 her word
Text=<She considers you for a long moment, and then, for the first time, she smiles.> A parcel that carries itself. <She takes a ring from her hand -- iron, a snake eating its tail -- and holds it out.> North, over the mountains, to the village under the peaks; you will know the road because everything on it will step aside for this. Give it to whoever asks you for it. Do not give it to anyone who does not. <The creatures at her feet slide back into the dark.> Nobody here will touch you. Nobody here will help you either.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=<Take the ring.>
